WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:04.130
- Did anybody else get a bear
hug from Batman? (laughs)

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.040
- No but, ah man, we were three weeks into

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.710
shooting and I didn't have no lines,

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.530
we were just doing all
of the basketball stuff.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.180
So when we had the scene
where he introduces himself

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.797
as the coach, I was so happy, I'm like

00:00:16.797 --> 00:00:18.810
"I finally get to speak, finally!"

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:23.070
And so, I remember when I
got ready to say my lines

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.860
and this guy cuts my line off,

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.185
and so
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:27.185 --> 00:00:30.425
I let it slide, y'know what I'm saying?

00:00:30.425 --> 00:00:33.258
(audience laughs)

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.840
- I let Ben Affleck slide. (laughs)

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.526
- Left the heater in the back, you know.

00:00:38.526 --> 00:00:39.370
- Oh, you are so bold.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.840
- No, he didn't let anything
slide, tell them the story.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.457
- I didn't 'cause he did it
one more time and I was like,

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:48.455
"Oh no, I'm not taking
this, Ben Affleck, who?"

00:00:48.455 --> 00:00:49.288
(audience laughs)

00:00:49.288 --> 00:00:53.510
And so, I just remember
I was talking with Melvin

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:56.363
and the group, I said "I'm
about to tell Ben Affleck off"

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.428
and they were like,
- [Kelly] Get off my line!

00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:00.637
- And they were like, "you're
crazy, don't do that,"

00:01:00.637 --> 00:01:02.470
and I ran over and I sprinted,

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:03.735
and I hit him right on
the chest I was like,

00:01:03.735 --> 00:01:08.390
"Hey man, you're stepping on
my lines, what's up with that?"

00:01:08.390 --> 00:01:09.223
You know what I mean?

00:01:09.223 --> 00:01:10.370
- [Kelly] I'm proud of that,
I've been waiting a minute.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.640
- I told him, "Ben
Affleck, you're Ben Affleck

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:14.190
you're in this movie,
you've got all the lines,

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.874
I don't got that many lines,
you know what I mean?"

00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:17.040
(audience laughter)

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:19.840
I need all the chances I can
get, and I had the script

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:22.050
and I was telling him the line, oh my god.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.175
- This story has grown, I mean.

00:01:24.175 --> 00:01:25.110
(audience laughter)

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:25.943
- I punched him in the face.

00:01:25.943 --> 00:01:28.960
- The truth is I stepped on his line once,

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:33.873
his line was "what," (laughter)
and I looked past it.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.663
I didn't even think about
it, and then he gave the

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:39.218
(mumbling)

00:01:39.218 --> 00:01:40.224
(laughter)

00:01:40.224 --> 00:01:42.192
What's going on?

00:01:42.192 --> 00:01:43.025
"that's my line you're stepping on."

00:01:43.025 --> 00:01:45.392
- Hey! (laughter) don't
make me sound like that.

00:01:45.392 --> 00:01:48.366
- Yo, what, that's my line!

00:01:48.366 --> 00:01:50.140
I have to say, I didn't
look at the other guys,

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:52.030
and they were all like (grimaces).

00:01:52.030 --> 00:01:54.514
- It was the same clip that
they showed before we came out,

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:56.532
he was spitting facts, he cut that off.

00:01:56.532 --> 00:01:58.377
- I did respect that, I was like,

00:01:58.377 --> 00:02:00.167
"this guy is not gonna let any

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:03.117
(mumbles) take his
line, my line is "what!"

00:02:03.987 --> 00:02:05.948
I'm gonna say my line.

00:02:05.948 --> 00:02:07.983
- That's my favorite, that's so bold!

